  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "逃出医院躲进卧室  (Unannounced Visitors at Chun Yuqiao's Door)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Sitting in Chun Yuqiao's spare apartment, Bu Xiaogu remarks on how spartan the room feels and shyly declines a blanket—until Chun Yuqiao's phone rings with news that Xingtian's chairwoman and executives are standing right outside his door. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这直男的房间非常冷清啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你冷啊？我给你开空调。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不是，你别动，没事，不用！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你不用客气的，你要冷的话，那儿有个毯子，你可以先披着。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不用，我不冷，我还有点热呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我电话不是这牌子的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "对，我从医院逃出来了，刚准备联系你呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们在我家门口？行，稍等。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这回家里真的热了，我怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长要发现我在你家，我怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你这样，你在卧室待着。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这直男的房间非常冷清啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A bachelor's room like this really looks austere and empty.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你冷啊？我给你开空调。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you cold? Let me turn up the air conditioning for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不是，你别动，没事，不用！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, do not get up—it is fine, really no need!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你不用客气的，你要冷的话，那儿有个毯子，你可以先披着。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No need to be polite; if you feel chilly there is a blanket over there you can drape around your shoulders.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不用，我不冷，我还有点热呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No need at all—I am not cold, I actually feel a bit warm.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我电话不是这牌子的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait—my phone is not that brand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "对，我从医院逃出来了，刚准备联系你呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, I escaped from the hospital and was just about to contact you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们在我家门口？行，稍等。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are all right outside my front door? Alright, give me a moment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这回家里真的热了，我怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now this apartment really is getting hot—what am I supposed to do?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长要发现我在你家，我怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If the chairwoman discovers I am here at your flat, what will I do?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你这样，你在卧室待着。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here—go stay inside my bedroom for now.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
